    <briefdescription>
<para>Describes a transfer message for the message-based transfer API. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The message-based transfer API is <ref refid="group__amd__xspi_1ga5ca6aa930b6c45be84fe284a58a792ad" kindref="member">AmdXspi_PolledTransfer()</ref> and <ref refid="group__amd__xspi_1ga956da3fd507245b807878ddf409b5029" kindref="member">AmdXspi_InterruptTransfer()</ref>.</para><para>Each message describes one Lite-mode transaction: command/address followed by a single data phase (transmit OR receive) within one chip-select window. </para>    </detaileddescription>
